      "message": "`Write \"sector size\" or \"crypto sector size\" ` - Ack\nReg sector size: We currently use the default 512B as the sector size of underlying virtual block device. It is customizable though. I\u0027ve summarized some thoughts on b/260329386. The most important thing (according to me) is how thee bigger sector size affect the sparse file usage \u0026 how the fragmentation can cause more (space) overhead in the backing storage.\nLets discuss that in the bug",
      "parentUuid": "93eba790_7915f03e",
